    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Troopers</strong> is a frenetic co-op shooter with a <strong>3D pixel art</strong> aesthetic, where you and your friends must survive relentless waves of insects, grotesque creatures, and enemies of all kinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is a hail of bullets, explosions, and flying bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Cooperate, defend, and annihilate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission offers different challenges: protect an area, hold out until evacuation, or completely clear the infestation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/extras/05152eeef3a8725d7add769d2a1932cc.avif?t=1755573648\" data-has-big width=800 height=194 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2b Classes and arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your class, equip your weapons\u2014which vary depending on your role\u2014and purchase new ones in the store between waves. From heavy rifles to flamethrowers, anything goes to stop the swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/extras/e18e119541d8f63b1eeba244cf251450.avif?t=1755573648\" width=800 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/extras/ca1e60907224b65caf2871e51a28e742.avif?t=1755573648\" data-has-big width=800 height=194 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 Pixelated brutality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy you eliminate leaves a trail. The insects splatter blood all over the landscape. Because yes: a good battlefield should look like one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/extras/4d87d4c8a9487abc8a526815c8b75275.avif?t=1755573648\" data-has-big width=800 height=194 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7e Co-op Multiplayer and Deathmatch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>co-op</strong> with your friends or face them in <strong>deathmatch</strong> to see who's the best <strong>Pixel Trooper</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/extras/e0f4b6bffd173f717f55710b1a3389d2.avif?t=1755573648\" width=800 height=195 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Troopers</strong> is a frenetic co-op shooter with a <strong>3D pixel art</strong> aesthetic, where you and your friends must survive relentless waves of insects, grotesque creatures, and enemies of all kinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is a hail of bullets, explosions, and flying bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Cooperate, defend, and annihilate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission offers different challenges: protect an area, hold out until evacuation, or completely clear the infestation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/extras/05152eeef3a8725d7add769d2a1932cc.avif?t=1755573648\" data-has-big width=800 height=194 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2b Classes and arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your class, equip your weapons\u2014which vary depending on your role\u2014and purchase new ones in the store between waves. From heavy rifles to flamethrowers, anything goes to stop the swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/extras/e18e119541d8f63b1eeba244cf251450.avif?t=1755573648\" width=800 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/extras/ca1e60907224b65caf2871e51a28e742.avif?t=1755573648\" data-has-big width=800 height=194 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 Pixelated brutality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy you eliminate leaves a trail. The insects splatter blood all over the landscape. Because yes: a good battlefield should look like one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/extras/4d87d4c8a9487abc8a526815c8b75275.avif?t=1755573648\" data-has-big width=800 height=194 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7e Co-op Multiplayer and Deathmatch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>co-op</strong> with your friends or face them in <strong>deathmatch</strong> to see who's the best <strong>Pixel Trooper</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/extras/e0f4b6bffd173f717f55710b1a3389d2.avif?t=1755573648\" width=800 height=195 /></span></p>",
